      "message": "Unfortunately this is also the most common intrinsic. Is it possible to add driver bug workarounds here? Or given build flags like `skia_compile_sksl_tests`, the SPIR-V cannot be tailored to the running GPU?\n\nIf we could instead tailor this to YCbCr, that would also work.",
